{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20387",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 3.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.45,
      "end_seconds": 9.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.17,
      "end_seconds": 20.85,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details. We came because of a bump on my head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.58,
      "end_seconds": 25.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 27.48,
      "end_seconds": 31.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "She takes amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.02,
      "end_seconds": 36.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 37.11,
      "end_seconds": 44.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "About a year now. She is on mirtazapine, 15 milligrams, at night, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.94,
      "end_seconds": 53.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "So, I'd been on fluoxetine, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.85,
      "end_seconds": 59.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "When did this begin? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.46,
      "end_seconds": 71.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Oh, it's been about two weeks, I'm fairly sure. I mean, you know, I've also been feeling dizzy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.82,
      "end_seconds": 76.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.26,
      "end_seconds": 82.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. I've also had a sore neck, since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.61,
      "end_seconds": 87.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Have you had a bit of nausea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.57,
      "end_seconds": 97.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "Yes, um, for about a week. As for bit of nausea, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.44,
      "end_seconds": 103.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Have you had any double vision, confusion or loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.02,
      "end_seconds": 110.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I haven't had double vision, confusion or loss of consciousness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.19,
      "end_seconds": 113.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Any vomiting or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.62,
      "end_seconds": 120.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Okay, so no vomiting or weakness, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.07,
      "end_seconds": 125.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Alright, any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.1,
      "end_seconds": 130.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I mean, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.93,
      "end_seconds": 134.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.21,
      "end_seconds": 137.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.51,
      "end_seconds": 142.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.13,
      "end_seconds": 161.77,
      "duration_seconds": 17.64,
      "text": "Mm, I've had high blood pressure for about a year now. I've never really been one for hospitals. I took the morning off to come in today. Depression, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.17,
      "end_seconds": 165.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "So, is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.89,
      "end_seconds": 171.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Alright, high blood pressure, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.43,
      "end_seconds": 185.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.28,
      "end_seconds": 187.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 189.49,
      "end_seconds": 198.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "I mean, hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to amoxicillin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.11,
      "end_seconds": 202.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.04,
      "end_seconds": 209.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Fair enough, I'll write down both versions. Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.54,
      "end_seconds": 215.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I had part of my thyroid removed years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.46,
      "end_seconds": 228.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.84,
      "end_seconds": 238.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.05,
      "end_seconds": 241.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Okay, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.39,
      "end_seconds": 245.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.4,
      "end_seconds": 249.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.36,
      "end_seconds": 260.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.05,
      "end_seconds": 291.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 80 beats a minute. And BP is 113 over 72, temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.84,
      "end_seconds": 298.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.68,
      "end_seconds": 302.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.76,
      "end_seconds": 307.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Alright, stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.73,
      "end_seconds": 329.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "There is a small bruise on the forehead, the pupils are equal and reactive, and you are walking steadily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.5,
      "end_seconds": 351.62,
      "duration_seconds": 16.12,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Putting it all together, my working impression is a minor head injury without worrying signs. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. We shouldn't forget a neck strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.56,
      "end_seconds": 359.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.75,
      "end_seconds": 371.07,
      "duration_seconds": 11.32,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a minor head injury without worrying signs, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.64,
      "end_seconds": 389.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "The treatment will be paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.3,
      "end_seconds": 392.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.64,
      "end_seconds": 407.61,
      "duration_seconds": 13.97,
      "text": "Someone should stay with you tonight, and no alcohol or contact sport for now. I'll want another look if the headache gets worse. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.44,
      "end_seconds": 411.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}